~ start
Nathan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is some dialogue.
# scene variables are from root scene by default
Nathan: Here are some choices.
- First one
	Nathan: You picked the first one.
- Second one
	Nathan: You picked the second one.
- Start again => start
- End the conversation => END
Nathan: For more information see the online documentation.
=> END

# Real World part 1
~ BookInteraction
 : [next=0.5] [do! DialogueSprite.fade_in()]
Morgan:: Ah..the Once and Future King.. I have to return it next week.
Morgan:: I'm not sure I'll finish it by then.. maybe I can renew it?"
do DialogueSprite.fade_out()
=> END!

~ PhotoInteraction
 : [next=0.5] [do! DialogueSprite.fade_in()]
Morgan: There's so much to do this week.. I need to clean the house, organize the trip..
Morgan: I'll work on it after I nap...maybe..
do DialogueSprite.fade_out()
=> END

# Real World part 2 -- back from Dream World
~ BackInRealWorld
 : [next=0.5] [do! DialogueSprite.fade_in()]
Morgan: Guess I can finally return this book after our trip!
do DialogueSprite.fade_out()
=> END

~ GoToSleep
do morgan.set_physics_process(false)
 : Go to sleep?
- Yes
	do morgan_sleep.emit()
	do DialogueSprite.fade_out()
	=> END
- No
	do DialogueSprite.fade_out()
	do morgan.set_physics_process(true)
	=> END

~ secret
  : ...
=> END

# -- Forest Dialogues
~ Forest
 : [next=0.5] [do! DialogueSprite.fade_in()]
Morgan: Where am I? These clothes...
Morgan: All I can remember is I was trying to finish my book and I knocked out.
Morgan: Could this be a dream?
do DialogueSprite.fade_out()
=> END

~ MeetShadowMorgan
 : [next=0.5] [do! DialogueSprite.fade_in()] [do DialogueSprite.show_dark_morgan()]
Morgan: Who is that?
Morgan: She looks like me... but different? Who are you?
Dark Morgan: ...
do DialogueSprite.hide_dark_morgan()
do Dialogic.start('MeetShadowMorgan')
do! DialogueSprite.fade_out_character_only()
=> END

~ AcquireSword
 : [next=0.5]  [do DialogueSprite.sword_acquired()] [do! DialogueSprite.fade_in()] 
Morgan: Where did this sword come from?
do DialogueSprite.show_morgan()
Morgan: I think this dream is telling me, I have to fight!
do DialogueSprite.sword_acquired()
 : Press Z/J to swing your sword!
do DialogueSprite.fade_out()
=> END